{
  "uid": "evenkeel-service",
  "title": "evenkeel \u2014 service",
  "description": "Which guard fired, and what it cost.",
  "tags": [
    "evenkeel"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**A client sees `503` whether the outbound call timed out, was shed by the concurrency cap, or ran out of retry budget.** The second row separates them; the rest is ordinary RED.\n\nEmpty panels mean no traffic, not a broken stack: metrics are off unless `APP__OBSERVABILITY__METRICS_ENABLED=true`. `make observe && make load` fills them, and the seconds you see belong to a stub deliberately stalling for 700ms \u2014 not to this service."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Requests",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate by status",
      "description": "Every response the service produced, including the refusals \u2014 409, 422 and 429 are answers, not failures.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "evenkeel-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 9,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 25,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "evenkeel-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(evenkeel_http_requests_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request latency",
      "description": "Buckets top out at 10s, so a p99 pinned at 10 means 'at least', not 'exactly'.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "evenkeel-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 9,
        "x": 9,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "evenkeel-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(evenkeel_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "evenkeel-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(evenkeel_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "evenkeel-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(evenkeel_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "In flight",
      "description": "Concurrency actually being served. Climbing while throughput is flat is the shape of a stall.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "evenkeel-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 5
